# ============================================================================
# GALAXY EXPLORER — PUBLIC DESTINATION CONFIGURATION (no secrets here)
# ============================================================================

# Endpoint of the external Type-II world (New Hospet). This is the ONLY
# place the destination URL is resolved (src/worlds/worldConfig.ts).
#
# When unset, the Galaxy Explorer runs normally and the New Hospet
# destination reports "not currently connected".
#
# Development stub (proves the handoff contract end to end):
#   VITE_TYPE2_WORLD_URL=http://localhost:5173/new-hospet.html
#
# Production example (the independently deployed Type-II project):
#   VITE_TYPE2_WORLD_URL=https://new-hospet.example.com
VITE_TYPE2_WORLD_URL=
